{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-subnet-design","title":"VPC 与子网设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/vpc-subnet-design","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"vpc-与子网设计\">VPC 与子网设计</h1><p>VPC（Virtual Private Cloud）的地址空间规划和子网拓扑决定了整个云网络架构的弹性上限。一个设计不当的 CIDR 分配方案会在后续的 VPC 互联、混合连接和容器编排中不断制造冲突，而修复成本随着系统规模指数增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>VPC（Virtual Private Cloud）</strong>：云中的逻辑隔离网络，拥有独立的 IP 地址空间、路由表和网络网关</li>\n<li><strong>CIDR（Classless Inter-Domain Routing）</strong>：无类别域间路由，用斜杠标记法（如 <code>/16</code>）表示网络前缀长度</li>\n<li><strong>子网（Subnet）</strong>：VPC 内按可用区划分的地址段，是资源部署和路由策略的最小单元</li>\n<li><strong>可用区（Availability Zone）</strong>：同一区域内物理隔离的数据中心集群，提供故障隔离</li>\n<li><strong>IPAM</strong>：IP 地址管理服务，集中管控跨账户、跨区域的地址分配与合规检查</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cidr-地址空间规划\">CIDR 地址空间规划</h2><p>CIDR（Classless Inter-Domain Routing）选择需要在&quot;足够大&quot;和&quot;不重叠&quot;之间取得平衡。RFC 1918 定义了三个私有地址段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地址段</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>可用地址数</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>10.0.0.0/8</code></td>\n<td>10.0.0.0 – 10.255.255.255</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>24</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>777</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>216</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{24} = 16,777,216</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">777</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">216</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大型企业主干</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>172.16.0.0/12</code></td>\n<td>172.16.0.0 – 172.31.255.255</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>048</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>576</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{20} = 1,048,576</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">048</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">576</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中型组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>192.168.0.0/16</code></td>\n<td>192.168.0.0 – 192.168.255.255</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>536</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{16} = 65,536</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">536</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小型网络 / 开发环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>企业级 VPC 设计通常在 <code>10.0.0.0/8</code> 内按区域和环境做二级划分。一种经过验证的编码方案是用第二个八位组编码区域，第三个八位组编码环境：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CIDR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>10.</mn><munder><munder><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>region</mtext></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><munder><munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>env</mtext></munder><mn>.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>prefix</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CIDR} = 10.\\underbrace{R}_{\\text{region}}.\\underbrace{E}_{\\text{env}}.0/\\text{prefix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CIDR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2016em;vertical-align:-1.4516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6845em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">region</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8506em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">env</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1494em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.0/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prefix</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 <code>10.1.0.0/16</code> 表示 us-east-1 的生产环境，<code>10.2.16.0/20</code> 表示 eu-west-1 的开发环境。这种规则化编址让运维人员看到 IP 就能判断归属。</p>\n<p>AWS VPC 允许的 CIDR 范围是 <code>/16</code> 到 <code>/28</code>，且支持最多 5 个次级 CIDR 块。Azure VNet 没有硬性前缀长度限制但建议不超过 <code>/8</code>。GCP VPC 是全局资源，子网是区域级别的，每个子网独立分配 CIDR。</p>\n<p>关键原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预留至少 30% 的地址空间给未来扩展</li>\n<li>避免使用 <code>100.64.0.0/10</code>（运营商级 NAT 地址）防止与云提供商内部冲突</li>\n<li>为 Kubernetes Pod 网络单独规划 CIDR（EKS 使用次级 CIDR，GKE 使用别名 IP 范围）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"子网分层架构\">子网分层架构</h2><p>子网的拆分策略直接映射到安全边界和路由策略。典型的三层子网模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    IGW[Internet Gateway]&#10;    subgraph VPC[&quot;VPC 10.1.0.0/16&quot;]&#10;        subgraph Public[&quot;公共子网 10.1.0.0/24&quot;]&#10;            ALB[Application Load Balancer]&#10;            NAT[NAT Gateway]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph Private[&quot;私有子网 10.1.16.0/20&quot;]&#10;            APP[应用层 EC2/ECS]&#10;            PODS[Kubernetes Pods]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph Data[&quot;数据子网 10.1.32.0/20&quot;]&#10;            RDS[(RDS/Aurora)]&#10;            CACHE[(ElastiCache)]&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;    IGW --&gt; ALB&#10;    ALB --&gt; APP&#10;    APP --&gt; RDS&#10;    APP --&gt; CACHE&#10;    NAT --&gt; IGW&#10;    PODS --&gt; NAT\">graph TB\n    IGW[Internet Gateway]\n    subgraph VPC[\"VPC 10.1.0.0/16\"]\n        subgraph Public[\"公共子网 10.1.0.0/24\"]\n            ALB[Application Load Balancer]\n            NAT[NAT Gateway]\n        end\n        subgraph Private[\"私有子网 10.1.16.0/20\"]\n            APP[应用层 EC2/ECS]\n            PODS[Kubernetes Pods]\n        end\n        subgraph Data[\"数据子网 10.1.32.0/20\"]\n            RDS[(RDS/Aurora)]\n            CACHE[(ElastiCache)]\n        end\n    end\n    IGW --&gt; ALB\n    ALB --&gt; APP\n    APP --&gt; RDS\n    APP --&gt; CACHE\n    NAT --&gt; IGW\n    PODS --&gt; NAT</pre><p>三层模型的设计逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>公共子网（Public）</strong>：托管面向互联网的入口资源（ALB、NAT Gateway、Bastion Host）。子网的路由表包含指向 Internet Gateway 的 <code>0.0.0.0/0</code> 路由。分配 <code>/24</code> 通常足够——这一层不部署计算实例。</li>\n<li><strong>私有子网（Private）</strong>：承载应用工作负载。通过 NAT Gateway 访问互联网用于拉取镜像和调用外部 API，但不接受入站互联网流量。这一层的地址空间需要最大，用 <code>/20</code> 或 <code>/19</code> 提供数千个 IP。</li>\n<li><strong>数据子网（Data / Isolated）</strong>：仅允许从私有子网入站连接。无 NAT 路由、无 Internet Gateway 路由——实现网络层的完全隔离。数据库和缓存集群部署在此。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多可用区部署模式\">多可用区部署模式</h2><p>高可用性要求每个子网层跨至少两个可用区（AZ）部署。AWS 的一个区域通常提供 3 个 AZ，Azure 提供 3 个可用区域，GCP 提供 3 个 Zone。跨 AZ 部署的子网划分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子网类型</th>\n<th>AZ-a</th>\n<th>AZ-b</th>\n<th>AZ-c</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公共子网</td>\n<td>10.1.0.0/24</td>\n<td>10.1.1.0/24</td>\n<td>10.1.2.0/24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有子网</td>\n<td>10.1.16.0/21</td>\n<td>10.1.24.0/21</td>\n<td>10.1.32.0/21</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据子网</td>\n<td>10.1.48.0/22</td>\n<td>10.1.52.0/22</td>\n<td>10.1.56.0/22</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每个 AZ 的 NAT Gateway 独立部署，确保单 AZ 故障不影响其他 AZ 的出站连接。AWS 对跨 AZ 的数据传输收费（截至 2026 年为 $0.01/GB），因此应用架构应尽量保持同 AZ 通信。</p>\n<p>多可用区设计中的一个常见陷阱是 EIP（弹性 IP）的 AZ 绑定——一个 EIP 只能绑定到同一 AZ 的资源。使用 Global Accelerator 或 NLB 来提供跨 AZ 的稳定入口 IP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地址空间碎片化治理\">地址空间碎片化治理</h2><p>随着 VPC 数量增长和多次扩容，地址空间碎片化是不可避免的。治理策略：</p>\n<p><strong>IPAM（IP Address Management）</strong>：AWS 在 2021 年推出的 VPC IPAM 服务可以集中管理跨区域、跨账户的 IP 地址分配。它支持地址池层级（Region Pool → Operating Pool → VPC Pool）和自动合规检查。Azure 通过 Network Manager 实现类似功能。</p>\n<p><strong>次级 CIDR 扩展</strong>：当主 CIDR 耗尽时，AWS 允许添加次级 CIDR 块（最多 5 个）。次级 CIDR 可以来自不同的地址段（甚至公有 IP 段），但需要注意 VPC Peering 不支持重叠 CIDR 的次级块。</p>\n<p><strong>IPv6 双栈</strong>：2026 年的最佳实践是为新建 VPC 启用 IPv6 双栈。AWS 自动为每个 VPC 分配一个 <code>/56</code> 的 IPv6 CIDR（从 Amazon 拥有的全局单播地址池），每个子网获得 <code>/64</code>。IPv6 消除了 NAT 的需求，但安全组和 NACL 仍然必须为 IPv6 流量配置规则。</p>\n<p>GCP 的 Shared VPC 模型在地址管理上提供了另一种思路：一个宿主项目（Host Project）拥有 VPC，多个服务项目（Service Project）共享使用其子网，从根本上减少了 VPC 数量和地址碎片。</p>\n<p>关于路由表如何将流量从这些子网导向正确的网关，参见 <a href=\"routing-tables-gateways\">路由表与网关</a>。安全组和 NACL 如何在子网边界施加访问控制，参见 <a href=\"security-groups-nacl\">安全组与网络 ACL</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>VPC 子网设计的核心决策链是：先确定全局 CIDR 编码方案避免未来冲突，再按三层模型（公共/私有/数据）划分安全边界，最后跨多可用区部署实现高可用。关键原则是预留足够扩展空间、避免地址重叠、为容器网络单独规划 CIDR。随着 IPv6 双栈的普及和 IPAM 服务的成熟，地址空间管理正从&quot;手动规划&quot;走向&quot;策略驱动的集中管控&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"VPC 与子网设计","id":"vpc-与子网设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CIDR 地址空间规划","id":"cidr-地址空间规划"},{"level":2,"text":"子网分层架构","id":"子网分层架构"},{"level":2,"text":"多可用区部署模式","id":"多可用区部署模式"},{"level":2,"text":"地址空间碎片化治理","id":"地址空间碎片化治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"路由表与网关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/routing-tables-gateways"}}